    "text": "<p>In the compound,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>CH</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>II</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><munder><mrow><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>CH</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>III</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder></math></p><p>The most acidic hydrogen atom is</p>",
